# The build context's inputs are committed; its outputs are not.
#
# `app.jar` is the pinned upstream release asset (222 MB), downloaded and
# verified by build-image.sh. It is never committed: the sha256 is the artefact,
# and a reviewer reproduces it from the release URL in one command.
app.jar
app.jar.part

# The package list is an intermediate of the SBOM step; the SBOM itself
# (`sbom.cdx.json`) and the extracted licence list (`licences/`) are published.
packages.tsv
__pycache__/
*.pyc
